        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break the Seal of Destiny</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die. Come back stronger. Try a new build. Repeat until you finally break the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the Seal of Destiny</strong> is a roguelite RPG with tactical 1v1 turn-based combat, where every decision can save your run… or end it instantly. Experiment with classes, abilities, and strategies as you fight your way through a world that constantly pushes you to your limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Run Tells a Different Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: survive long enough to reach <strong>Exploration Level 100</strong> and break the cycle once and for all. A single run can last a few minutes… or several intense hours, depending on how far your strategy takes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you die?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s where the real progression begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>Destiny Points</strong> after every defeat and spend them on permanent upgrades that make future runs stronger, faster, and more unpredictable. Every failure unlocks new possibilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Combat That Rewards Smart Decisions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t button mashing. Every fight matters.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense 1v1 turn-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between attacking, defending, or using powerful abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use status effects like Bleeding, Poison, Inner Fire, Regeneration, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade abilities up to Level 8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create devastating combos and unique playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One perfect move can completely turn the battle around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>7 unique professions</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire Magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ether Magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light Magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From destructive spellcasters to durable warriors and tactical masterminds — find the build that fits your style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 unique heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 skill slots during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless combinations of abilities and synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No inventory clutter. No unnecessary grinding.<br>Your choices and strategy are what truly matter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World Full of Risk and Randomness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into <strong>4 acts</strong>, each with its own atmosphere, enemies, and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every battle, you choose between two random destinations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a safe camp,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a dangerous encounter,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mysterious event,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or another deadly fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map. No guaranteed path.<br>Every run becomes its own adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tons of Unlockables and Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 achievements unlocking new content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New heroes and abilities to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encyclopedia tracking enemies, effects, items, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 30 hours of content for completionists and build hunters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Death Makes You Stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle brings you closer to destiny.<br>Every defeat is another chance to evolve.<br>Every build could be the one that finally breaks the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you break the Seal of Destiny?</strong></p>",
